Do note that there is a significant difference between "an FAQ for
NetHack" and "an FAQ for rec.games.roguelike.nethack". The former
would be a much more complicated beast than the latter, and quite
possibly _would_ benefit from the wiki treatment.

(There have been several attempts at starting NetHack wikis; I
regularly receive requests for permission to incorporate my spoiler
collection (always granted, under the standard conditions). As far as
I know, none of them have gained critical mass.)

